@startuml
title RPRRSBSI V4-2 Plugin Database Expansion
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

artifact "Signed plugin manifest" as Manifest
component "Plugin host\ncapability mediation" as Host
component "Host repositories" as Repo
database "Outpost local projection" as Edge
database "Ace mutable plane" as Ace
database "ATAPUtilities\npublished reference" as Atap
component "Isolated change workspace" as Workspace
component "Ace migration gate" as AceGate
component "productionPublishNewOrModifiedPlugin" as Publish

Manifest --> Host : identity, version,\npermissions, data contract
Host --> Repo : no arbitrary SQL
Repo --> Edge
Repo --> Ace
Manifest --> Workspace : bounded proposal
Workspace --> AceGate : validated immutable package
AceGate --> Ace : forward-only declared effects
Ace --> Publish : content-addressed candidate
Publish --> Atap : approved new release

note bottom of Host
  Runtime plugin installation performs no DDL.
  Tags never grant permissions.
end note

note bottom of Publish
  Synchronization is not publication.
  Ordinary Ace principals have no ATAP write.
end note
@enduml
